{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52191","headline":"颂六十二首 十六 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五慾昏神识，五盖蔽福力。\n六根成苦集，六贼乱心色。\n慾泿逐情飘，爱网随心织。\n三毒障人空，四流漂不息。\n至金虽改秋，斩筹方未极。\n观鸽既无穷，猿攀此焉（一作「乌」）伏。\n自非绝慾盖，何能远昇陟。\n齐獁（一作「⿰车犬」）届宝城，共覩能仁德。\n（见同书卷十二《慾盖部》。\n注一作者，爲《法苑珠林》卷八九之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}